HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The cccc__ccuubbiicc congestion control module first appeared in FreeBSD 9.0.

     This became the default congestion algorithm for FreeBSD in version
     FreeBSD 14.0, replacing cc_newreno(4).

     The module was first released in 2009 by Lawrence Stewart whilst studying
     at Swinburne University of Technology's Centre for Advanced Internet Ar‐
     chitectures, Melbourne, Australia.  More details are available at:

     http://caia.swin.edu.au/urp/newtcp/

